Day 49- LeetCode 543: (Diameter of Binary Tree)
For this problem, I used a similar DFS + recursion approach.
While calculating the height of each node, I also calculated the longest path passing through that node using:
leftHeight + rightHeight
I kept updating the maximum diameter during the traversal.

TC: O(n)
SC: O(h)- recursion stack
The interesting part of these two problems was seeing how the height of a binary tree can be used to solve different problems, instead of doing multiple traversals.
